From: mwlaboratories <info@mwlabs.be>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qdsp6: q6voice: move a running call to a new port

The CVP session is created with the AFE ports of the voice path, and
q6voice_set_port() only stores the new port. A call that is moved to
another port by the mixer (OnePlus 6: earpiece on SLIMBUS_0_RX, speaker
on QUAT_MI2S_RX) therefore keeps sending to the old port, which DPCM has
just shut down: speakerphone during a call is silent.

When the port of a running path changes, stop the path, release the CVP
session and start the path again, which creates the CVP session on the
new port. A port cleared to 0 is the first half of a move (UCM switches
the old route off before the new one on), so wait for the new port.

The new CVP session starts before DPCM prepares the new back end, the
same order as at call start (FE startup before BE prepare).

q6voice_path_stop() returns early without a CVP session, so a failed
move does not oops at the end of the call.
---
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6voice.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6voice.c
@@ -176,6 +176,10 @@
 
 	dev_dbg(dev, "stop path %d\n", p->type);
 
+	/* A failed move to another port leaves no CVP session behind. */
+	if (!mvm || !cvp)
+		return;
+
 	ret = q6mvm_start(mvm, false);
 	if (ret)
 		dev_err(dev, "failed to stop voice: %d\n", ret);
@@ -296,11 +300,42 @@
 		      bool capture, int index)
 {
 	struct q6voice_path *p = &v->paths[path];
+	int *port = capture ? &p->tx_port : &p->rx_port;
+	struct q6voice_session *cvp;
+	int ret;
 
-	if (capture)
-		p->tx_port = index;
-	else
-		p->rx_port = index;
+	mutex_lock(&p->lock);
+	if (*port == index)
+		goto out;
+	*port = index;
+
+	/*
+	 * The CVP session is created with the AFE ports of the path, so a
+	 * running call stays on its old port when the mixer moves it (e.g.
+	 * from the earpiece to the speaker). Re-create the session on the new
+	 * port. A port cleared to 0 is the first half of such a move (the old
+	 * route is switched off before the new one is switched on): wait for
+	 * the new port.
+	 */
+	if (!index || !p->runtime || p->runtime->started != 3)
+		goto out;
+
+	dev_dbg(v->dev, "move path %d %s to port %d\n", path,
+		capture ? "tx" : "rx", index);
+
+	cvp = p->runtime->sessions[Q6VOICE_SERVICE_CVP];
+	if (cvp) {
+		q6voice_path_stop(p);
+		q6voice_session_release(cvp);
+		p->runtime->sessions[Q6VOICE_SERVICE_CVP] = NULL;
+	}
+
+	ret = q6voice_path_start(p);
+	if (ret)
+		dev_err(v->dev, "failed to move path %d to port %d: %d\n",
+			path, index, ret);
+out:
+	mutex_unlock(&p->lock);
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(q6voice_set_port);
 
